description = "A Libretro core for playing classic video game music in RetroArch, with a built-in graphical interface: a browsable track list, VU meter, spectrum analyzer, and playback controls. Plays SPC/NSF/GBS/HES/KSS/SAP/AY/GYM (libgme), VGM/VGZ (libvgm), MOD/S3M/XM/IT (libxmp-lite) PSF/PSF2/SSF (aosdk) and streamed audio -- CD-XA, Sony VAG, CRI ADX/AHX, Nintendo GC/Wii DSP and more (vgmstream). Accepts .zip albums and .chd disc images -- including the CD-DA soundtrack of a real game disc -- and plays tracks in natural order."
